    "plain_text": "Roberto Cavalli built an Italian fashion label recognised for animal prints, decorated denim and a deliberately flamboyant style. His clothes attracted performers including Beyoncé, Jennifer Lopez and Shakira. Alongside the main collection, he developed Just Cavalli, extending his design vocabulary into a younger line and broadening the reach of his name.",
